    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The has wbs property in the integrated project information model. Its declared domain is WorkPackage and its declared range is WBS_Element.</rdfs:comment>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">Editorial definition added for proposed IproK 0.2.0; inspect the retained source and mapping record.</dcterms:description>
